              "handle": "claudeai"
            },
            "text": "We’re renaming our Max plans: \n\nMax 5x → Max\nMax 20x → Ultra\n\nMax is still $100/month, and Ultra is still $200. If you’re a subscriber, there’s nothing you need to do.\n\nWe’re also removing the 5-hour limit for verified Ultra accounts, starting today with most existing subscribers. Newer accounts keep a temporary limit until they’re verified, which helps us prevent fraud and abuse. You'll get an email when it's removed.\n\nWeekly limits remain unchanged. View our plans here:  claude.com/pricing",
